You should create a NewTimer

```go
func NewTimer(ctx context, d time.Duration) func(context.Context) error {
   return func(ctx context.Context) error {
            select { 
                 case <- ctx.Done: 
                 return nil 
                 case <- time.After(2 * time.Second): 
                 return nil
            }
}
``

This way you can reuse it. Here I'm using a context as described before, but you can also do without

